.\nI would like to send a request to illustrate my character.\nThe boy's name is Lexmia, about 158cm tall, relatively small body.\nhttps://imgur.com/a/lexmia-kun-5LPUjJ6\nThe scene is when Lexmia has successfully caught the criminal in an alley, and is using this pose and pointing the weapon down to threaten the criminal:\nhttps://x.com/oiseau_bonjour/status/1402066506830123012/photo/1\nhttps://assets.clip-studio.com/fr-fr/detail?id=2122917\nI would like the drawing to be from the perspective of the criminal looking up at Lexmia, you can see his slightly plump legs and boxers.\nLinks containing Lexmia's photo sources will be taken down in a few days once the request is accepted. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/lexmia-kun-5LPUjJ6", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Kubari_Kanya123/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/95f1be67/uploads/origins/d00539aa-1359-4428-b589-6a3002d1f4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1511fb888cf5c7ae65635fe011a4c15d", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2185810, "client_id": 3375294, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 31080, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ダミィ蚕🌱", "screen_name": "dummy_13", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1829137600503848960/L4EjO4RD.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/962945000/1674070761/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "dele